          %p
            (where we used first the Jacobi identity
            %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:JacobiIdentity"} (7)
            and then the invariance
            %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:AdInvarianceOfInvariantPolynomial"} (14)
            of the bilinear pairing)
          %p
            and is invariant under
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cyclic+permutation"} cyclic permutation
            of its arguments:
